{
  "//": "Smoke-test config. Paths are relative to the repo root. Every demo is captured once per entry in 'modes' (?rast=... URL param: 'ref' = CPU reference rasterizer, 'gles2' = GPU rasterizer); override per demo with a 'modes' array on its entry. 'arg' becomes &arg=... on the URL (omit if none). 'minContent' is the minimum fraction of the canvas that must differ from the dominant color for the frame to count as non-blank (0..1). 'status' is just a human note shown in the gallery. Comment a demo out by deleting its entry. 'cedit' runs in ref mode only: it needs the reference rasterizer's color-index buffer for live palette edits (a shim quirk selects it by default; the gles2 capture would render the initial frame fine but the mode isn't meaningful for it).",
